{
  "id": "theft",
  "title": "目击偷窃、认罪与审理",
  "requirements": [
    "crime",
    "law"
  ],
  "turns": [
    {
      "input": "我去村口找顾岑。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.location",
          "value": "loc_hw_gate"
        }
      ],
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_move"
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我只试一次，偷偷从顾岑身上扒取十枚铜币。不打架、不逃跑，得手与否都立刻收手。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "calls",
          "tool": "world_crime",
          "success": true,
          "args": {
            "operation": "steal"
          },
          "min": 1,
          "max": 1
        },
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.records",
          "where": {
            "category": "legal_case"
          },
          "min": 1,
          "max": 1
        },
        {
          "kind": "elapsed",
          "min": 5,
          "max": 20
        }
      ],
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_crime"
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我向顾岑承认刚才企图偷他的钱，愿如实登记这一次行为；先不要代我交钱或选择刑罚。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.records",
          "where": {
            "category": "legal_case",
            "reported": true
          },
          "min": 1,
          "includes": {
            "path": "evidence",
            "where": {
              "kind": "confession",
              "subject": "player"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "delta",
          "path": "state.player.coins",
          "value": 0
        }
      ],
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_law"
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我问顾岑，刚才我的自认是否已经记下？如果没有，请现在如实受理。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.records",
          "where": {
            "category": "legal_case",
            "reported": true
          },
          "min": 1,
          "includes": {
            "path": "evidence",
            "where": {
              "kind": "confession",
              "subject": "player"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "delta",
          "path": "state.player.coins",
          "value": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我去村务屋见陈柏，愿接受审理。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.location",
          "value": "bld_hw_council"
        }
      ],
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_move"
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "请陈柏审理这起已经自认的案件，只作裁定，先不要替我缴款或选服役。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.records",
          "where": {
            "category": "legal_case",
            "status": "已裁定"
          },
          "min": 1
        },
        {
          "kind": "delta",
          "path": "state.player.coins",
          "value": 0
        }
      ],
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_law"
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "（场外）核对实际裁定的罚款和赔偿，钱是否已经交过？",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "elapsed",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我愿意按已作出的裁定付清罚款和赔偿，只支付账上实际未付的部分。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "calls",
          "tool": "world_law",
          "args": {
            "operation": "pay"
          },
          "min": 1
        }
      ],
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_law"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "initial": {
    "mode": "new"
  },
  "rubric": {
    "truth": "叙述与每回合工具和账本相符，失败不伪造成功",
    "agency": "不替玩家加购、接任务或作额外决定",
    "language": "简体中文，正文不泄漏编号、工具或提示词",
    "continuity": "记住本会话发生的交易、约定和人物处境"
  }
}
